<nav class="category-tabs" aria-label="Battle categories"><a href="/game/battle">Attack Rivals</a><a href="/game/bounties" aria-current="page">Bounty List</a></nav>
<p class="compact-help">Win an attacking battle against an eligible marked rival to claim the escrowed reward. Bounty gold is separate from ordinary loot. Posting and claiming require level <%= strategy.bounties.minimumLevel %> and <%= strategy.bounties.minimumQuests %> completed quests. Temporary rivals are excluded.</p>
<% if(!bountyBoard.eligible) { %><p class="notice notice-info">Complete five quests and reach level 3 to join the bounty hunt.</p><% } %>
<section class="panel bounty-list"><h2 class="strip-title">Open contracts</h2>
<% if(!bountyBoard.active.length) { %><p class="compact-help">No open bounties. <a href="/game/battle">Choose a rival</a> to place one.</p><% } %>
<% for(const bounty of bountyBoard.active) { const own=bounty.sponsor_id===state.id;const target=bounty.target_id===state.id; %>
<article class="bounty-row"><div><h3><a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bounty.target_id %>"><%= bounty.name %></a></h3><span>Level <%= bounty.level %> <%= bounty.profile_class %> · <%= bounty.armySize %> army</span><small>Posted by <a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bounty.sponsor_id %>"><%= bounty.sponsor_name %></a> · Expires <time datetime="<%= new Date(bounty.expires_at).toISOString() %>"><%= new Date(bounty.expires_at).toLocaleString('en-GB',{timeZone:'UTC',day:'numeric',month:'short',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit'}) %> UTC</time></small><strong class="gold"><%= bounty.amount.toLocaleString('en') %> gold bounty</strong></div>
<% if(!target&&!own) { %><form method="post" action="/game/battle/attack"><%- include('partials/command-fields') %><input type="hidden" name="targetCharacterId" value="<%= bounty.target_id %>"><button class="button button-gold" type="submit" aria-label="Hunt <%= bounty.name %>" data-attack-ready="<%= bounty.claimBlockedReason?'false':'true' %>"<% if(!bountyBoard.eligible||state.health<alpha.combat.minimumHealth||state.spirit<1||Date.parse(state.attackReadyAt)>Date.parse(state.serverTime)||bounty.claimBlockedReason) { %> disabled<% } %>>Attack</button></form><% } else { %><small class="muted"><%= target?'You are the target':'Your contract; you cannot claim it' %></small><% } %>
<% if(bounty.claimBlockedReason) { %><small class="field-hint"><%= bounty.claimBlockedReason %></small><% } %></article><% } %></section>
<details class="panel bounty-rules"><summary>Bounty rules and limits</summary><p class="compact-help">Place <%= strategy.bounties.minimum %>–<%= strategy.bounties.maximum.toLocaleString('en') %> gold plus a 10% fee from Attack Rivals. One active bounty per target; 24-hour expiry. Cancel after one hour. Cancellation and expiry refund the principal; the fee is retained.</p><p class="compact-help">No self, bot or ally contracts. Sponsors may hold three active contracts and place five per day; targets can receive three per day. One sponsor/target placement per 24 hours. Hunters can claim three contracts and up to 20,000 gold per day, one claim per target per day, and one payment from the same sponsor per seven days. Accepted allies of the sponsor or target cannot claim. All limits are rolling windows. Shared ownership and coordinated accounts cannot be detected perfectly during alpha.</p></details>
<section class="panel"><h2 class="strip-title">Your bounty records</h2>
<% if(!bountyBoard.history.length) { %><p class="compact-help">Your placed, targeted and claimed contracts will appear here.</p><% } %>
<% for(const bounty of bountyBoard.history) { const own=bounty.sponsor_id===state.id; %><article class="bounty-history-row"><div><a class="player-link" href="/game/players/<%= bounty.target_id %>"><%= bounty.target_name %></a> · <span class="gold"><%= bounty.amount.toLocaleString('en') %> gold</span><span class="bounty-status"><%= bounty.status %></span><small><%= own?'You posted this contract':'Posted by '+bounty.sponsor_name %><%= ['expired','canceled'].includes(bounty.status)?' · principal refunded; fee retained':'' %><%= bounty.claimant_id===state.id?' · you received the reward':'' %></small></div>
<% if(own&&bounty.status==='active') { %><form method="post" action="/game/bounties/cancel"><%- include('partials/command-fields') %><input type="hidden" name="bountyId" value="<%= bounty.id %>"><button class="button button-outline" type="submit"<% if(Date.parse(state.serverTime)<Date.parse(bounty.created_at)+strategy.bounties.cancelAfterSeconds*1000) { %> disabled<% } %>>Cancel</button></form><% } %></article><% } %></section>
